  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the gochujang and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in the pork broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Add the bun noodles and cook, stirring occasionally, until they are slightly tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the soy sauce and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Season with ground black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with green onions and serve hot."
  ],
